{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is visible, move to it. If not, scan the area. Approach, grab, check and do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToTarget    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
